### Page 3 of 3

```text
A C OM M U N I TY OF C HO ICE
DEVELOPMENT OFFICE
2101 O’Neil Avenue, Suite 202, Cheyenne, WY  82001
(Email) jtetzlaff@cheyennecity.org   ◦   (Phone) 307-637-6258   ◦   (Fax) 307-637-6366

MEMORANDUM

TO:

City Council Members and Mayor Kaysen

FROM:
Josh Tetzlaff, Planner

SUBJECT:
Amendment by substitution of an ordinance for Waterford Square Annexation (UDC-
15-00051)

DATE:
May 6, 2015

The attached ordinance amends an ordinance approving the Waterford Square annexation that was
approved by the Governing Body on April 13, 2015.  After the Waterford Square annexation ordinance
was approved, the City attempted to record the annexation ordinance and the attached annexation map
in the offices of the Laramie County Clerk.  The City is required to record annexation ordinances and
maps pursuant to W.S. 15-1-406(a).

The Laramie County Clerk refused to record the annexation ordinance and map because the words
“Cheyenne Irrigated Gardens, 2nd Filing” did not follow the reference to Tract 35 that appears in the
entitlement to the ordinance.  This reason for the refusal to record the annexation ordinance and map
may be somewhat overly technical since the annexation map attached to the original ordinance makes it
clear that Tract 35 is part of “Cheyenne Irrigated Gardens, 2nd Filing.”

This amendment to the original annexation ordinance satisfies the concerns of the Laramie County Clerk
because the words “Cheyenne Irrigated Gardens, 2nd Filing” will be inserted into the entitlement and into
Section 1.a of the original ordinance.

Thank you.

Encl:
Amended Ordinance

Cc:
File

Owner/Agent

City Attorney

City Clerk
```
